        },
        {
          "text": " Baasha ogwo omugabe wa Israeli yainamuka, yaateera Yuda, yaayombeka Raama, ngu azibire omuntu weena okuruga omu bugabe bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, nari okubwijamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
