                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Nadabu mwene Yeroboamu akatandika kutegyeka Israeli; yaategyekyera Israeli emyaka ebiri. ",
          "type": "text",
