          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Baasha mwene Ahiya akatandika kutegyeka Israeli yoona ari Tiruza, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka makumi abiri n'ena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
